conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">HL7 Imaging Study Status</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSImagingStudy.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSImagingStudy-definitions.html#EHDSImagingStudy.presentedForm\" title=\"PDF version of the imaging study to be used where DICOM version is not available. This is a fallback option and is not intended to replace the exchange of DICOM imaging studies.\">presentedForm</a><a name=\"EHDSImagingStudy.presentedForm\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSAttachment.html\">EHDSAttachment</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">PDF version of the imaging study to be used where DICOM version is not available. This is a fallback option and is not intended to replace the exchange of DICOM imaging studies.<br/></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" c